ἱ νῆες</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.67</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> also <span class=\"gk\">ῥᾴδιόν ἐστι</span> it is <b class=\"lex-tr\">a light matter, you think little</b> of doing, <span class=\"gk\">παρ' ὑμῖν ῥ. ξενοκτονεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1247</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> phrase, <span class=\"gk\">ἐκ ῥᾳδίας</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">easily</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plot.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.8.1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy-going, adaptable</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ῥ. ἤθεα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1116</span> </span> (lyr.); in bad sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">reckless, unscrupulous</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ῥ. τὸν τρόπον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Merc.Cond.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">40</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alex.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ῥ. τὼ ὀφθαλμώ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">having a roving</b> eye, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alciphr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.6</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.2</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ῥᾳδιουργός</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-le